---
title: Maintenance
description: Keep FOSSBilling updated, healthy, and recoverable.
---

Use this section for routine maintenance, recovery tasks, troubleshooting, and release tracking.

If you are maintaining a production installation, keep [Updating](/maintenance/updating/) and [Security](/security/) close together: updates are often part of the security posture, not a separate concern.

